OL,3,GNEWSAFire ravages field near small
OL,4,Avillage
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have tackled a blaze at a
OL,7,Ffield in West Sussex.
OL,9,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid at about 15:45 BST on Saturday
OL,11,Fthat it was dealing with the incident
OL,12,Fclose to West Chiltington Lane, near
OL,13,FConeyhurst.
OL,15,FLocal residents were advised to avoid
OL,16,Fthe area before firefighters said at
OL,17,Fabout 18:15 that the response was
OL,18,F"being scaled down" and crews were
OL,19,Fpreparing to leave.
OL,21,FThe cause of the fire is not yet known.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
